Nothing is linked and nothing is copied. This gem has no compiled extension:
GObjectIntrospection::Loader opens GstPbutils-1.0.typelib at require time and
defines Ruby classes from what it finds there. The typelib is a description of
the library's API, it belongs to the host's gst-plugins-base installation, and
it is not distributed with this gem. No part of gst-plugins-base is copied into
this repository or into a built gem, and no header, source file or declaration
of it is reproduced here.

The LGPL applies to that library, not to this work. Loading an
LGPL-2.1-or-later library's introspection data from an Apache-2.0 work is
further from the licence's reach than the dynamic linkage it already permits.

