ruby-gnome
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The loader in lib/gstreamer_pbutils/loader.rb is written on the model of
ruby-gnome's own GObject Introspection loaders -- gtksourceview5 and libsecret
in particular -- and runs on ruby-gnome's gobject-introspection gem.

  https://github.com/ruby-gnome/ruby-gnome
  Copyright 2003-2026 the Ruby-GNOME Project Team
  Licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later

ruby-gnome is a gem dependency, resolved by RubyGems at install time. No part
of it is copied into this repository or into a built gem.
